{"seq":71,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2510"},"reason":"Added that the claim has no population count behind it (it traces to an old unsourced web page) and is doubtful, since Australia alone has hundreds of millions of feral European rabbits — the caveat was only in the notes.","by":"provenance-alternatives","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",555],["+"," The claim is doubtful, though: no population count lies behind it – it traces back to an old unsourced web page – and feral European rabbits in Australia alone number in the hundreds of millions."],["=",510]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",505],["+"," Belegt ist das allerdings nicht: Hinter der Behauptung steht keine Zählung – sie geht auf eine alte Webseite ohne Quellen zurück –, und allein in Australien leben Hunderte Millionen verwilderter Europäischer Kaninchen."],["=",460]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",497],["+"," Однако это утверждение сомнительно: никакого подсчёта численности за ним нет – оно восходит к старой веб-странице без источников, – а одних только одичавших европейских кроликов в Австралии сотни миллионов."],["=",484]]}],"hash":"6af57a8274fc","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-alternatives"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"d644ef8db23dad8de7f26ef66660d4180b62551d854c6b9787ec98156319f700"},
